  "binding": "Successful SpawnSummons -> owning HitSelectionSnapshot.SpawnedUnits -> shared scene -> native graph clock -> original model/generation graph",
  "operation": "Add presentation-only identity, initial cell and cast-local flight plus original sorted Base scope delay for each successful role summon. Retain eager settlement, RNG, placement and status order. Delay model/HUD creation on the existing native graph clock. Restore existing roles without replaying generation. Position the native monster before original birth graph initialization. Queue existing explicit entity-removal receipts for pending births as well as visible units; dispatch birth before removal at equal times, suppress births after an earlier removal, and deduplicate removed identities. A settled Ended flag does not hide a living summon before its recorded removal boundary. No source prefab, texture, mesh, shader or animation asset is changed."
}
